{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026K7dkWtPooj1793462902.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>尖沙咀昨晚有男子懷疑醉酒失足跌落平台，壓中一名外傭，二人都清醒送院。</p><p></p><p>受傷男子送往伊利沙伯醫院救治，他戴住頸箍，現場消息指，他在屋苑會所燒烤時，懷疑飲醉跌落平台花槽。</p><p></p><p>事發在昨晚7點43分，柯士甸道西1號君臨天下，男子被發現在平台，懷疑墮下時砸中一名女子，救護員到場時，二人均清醒，受傷女子是外傭，送往廣華醫院救治。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FALLING-0000 new.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HKrxc2icQT1793465187.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:34.522726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T16:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.176059+00:00","content_hash":"1d1bbd5306101283f37c7ec97fe1d5ad84be81a672743768b5d448cf5ebfd03b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:34.522726+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}